完美锐利，而是强调真实与氛围。\n\n图像提示词：一位年轻女性站在城市街道中央，身穿黑色方领无袖连衣裙，长发随风轻扬，右手轻抚发丝，眼神直视镜头，表情沉静自信，佩戴金色耳环。背景为欧洲风格钟楼与红砖建筑，街道两侧停有白色车辆，远处行人模糊可见。天空淡蓝带浅云，光线柔和，似黄昏或清晨。构图中景人像，人物居中偏左，前景地面略虚，中景街道与车辆形成城市肌理，背景钟楼高耸，天空开阔。整体色调沉静，黑灰蓝为主，点缀金色与暖色建筑，光影柔和自然，画面带有轻微日常拍摄质感与景深虚化，不追求完美锐利，强调真实与氛围。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 76, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [323.5193176269531, 363.92364501953125], "pos": [1149.8470458984375, 768.5773315429688], "id": 88, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [79], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "string1", "link": 77, "label": "string1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "string2", "link": 78, "label": "string2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string2"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JoinStrings", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [210, 78], "pos": [1498.74951171875, 628.2223510742188], "id": 89, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-kjnodes", "ver": "6c996e1877db08c7de020ee14421dd28d7574ec2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JoinStrings"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "links": [10], "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}], "size": [394.7535095214844, 106], "color":